      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Feeling done is not a flaw but the healthy conclusion of a hard-won life, proving you didn't need endless noise to feel alive. The world's endless chase often disguises fear of stillness, yet your peace is valid ground for building something quiet on your own terms. You have already succeeded when you refuse to be forced into a story that no longer fits the person who has finally arrived.",
